    <p><strong>Success criteria:</strong> use at least one neutral relationship word and one specific relationship word; use one correct plural, including <span class="ex">children</span> if it fits; use two possessive adjectives; use a name with possessive <span class="ex">'s</span>; and never ask your partner to guess a role from appearance.</p>
